  "created_at": "Wed Jan 31 23:57:44 +0000 2018",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "This was followed by the price, which passed $10 and felt like crazy. Suddenly we had a longer runway and everyone could breathe again. There was and still is a lot of work ahead of us...",
