  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "But probably none of that would have happened had @mingchan88 not stepped in her role. She was never in the forefront, had no public face other than a few words before Devcon. But on the inside she was crucial, and she worked through multiple Christmas, Thanksgiving and New Years",
  "lang": "en",
