  "created_at": "Wed Jan 31 23:57:46 +0000 2018",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "The Ethereum Foundation is far from perfect, of course. We can do a lot to be more open and transparent, and to act less like a raunchy startup but the leadership of a $200 bilion ecosystem. But to get here, a lot of people had to do big sacrifices that went unthanked.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
